Do not free the frequency and histogram tools' bin range twice.

gnm_frequency_tool_perform_calc and gnm_histogram_tool_perform_calc wrap
the dialog's bin range (tool->bin) in gnm_expr_new_constant, which takes
the value over and frees it with the expression, and then
gnm_frequency_tool_finalize and gnm_histogram_tool_finalize release
tool->bin again when the command leaves the undo list: a double free
(an invalid go_format_unref on macOS) for every Frequency Tables or
Histogram run with predetermined categories or cutoffs, once the run is
undone and another command pushes it off the redo list.  Found through
the Cocoa front end on 2026-10-12; the GTK front end runs the same code.
Hand the expression a copy.

--- a/src/tools/analysis-frequency.c	2026-10-12 19:23:03
